{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2096183","field_id":"demo-cf-3","value":"<p><strong>Support the paper audit trail requirement; procurement timeline is the critical risk.</strong> State procurement realistically takes 18–24 months from RFP to delivery. Counties need authorization to begin in 2026 to meet the 2028 deadline.</p><ul><li>Amendment needed: authorize counties to initiate procurement in 2026, not contingent on bill enactment date</li><li>Paper record retention period unspecified — recommend 22-month minimum to cover post-election audit windows</li></ul>","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-30>"}
