{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2099974","field_id":"demo-cf-3","value":"<p><strong>Key concern: cost allocation for fire district elections.</strong> Section 3 requires county boards to maintain drop boxes, but is silent on which entity bears retrieval costs when a municipality administers the fire district election. We've requested a clarifying amendment — \\"county board of elections or its designee\\" — to allow cost delegation to municipal clerks.</p><ul><li>Chain of custody requirements align with existing municipal protocols — no new infrastructure needed</li><li>Amendment request submitted to sponsor's office; response pending</li></ul>","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-60>"}
{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2099974","field_id":"demo-cf-4","value":"2026-11-01","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-60>"}
{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2099974","field_id":"demo-cf-5","value":"1","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-30>"}
{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2100182","field_id":"demo-cf-1","value":"Significant (>$100K)","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-60>"}
{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2100182","field_id":"demo-cf-2","value":"Voter Access","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-60>"}
{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2100182","field_id":"demo-cf-3","value":"<p><strong>Significant operational lift — position pending impact analysis.</strong> Any-polling-place voting converts every polling site into a provisional ballot processing center for the full county.</p><ul><li>Provisional ballot volume modeling underway based on 2024 general election data</li><li>Poll worker training will need to be redesigned before rollout</li><li>Post-election adjudication window tightens with a larger provisional pool</li></ul>","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-60>"}
{"bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2100182","field_id":"demo-cf-5","value":"1","set_by":"demo-dir","updated_at":"<d-30>"}
### notes (8)
{"id":"demo-note-1","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2099974","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Review chain of custody language in Section 3 before committee hearing — clarify who bears cost for fire district drop box retrieval","created_at":"<d-60>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-2","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2100182","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Get provisional ballot volume estimate from James before Senate committee hearing","created_at":"<d-30>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-3","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2098535","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Pull 2024 cycle registration data for the final 30 days — needed to assess 14-day window feasibility","created_at":"<d-21>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-4","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2096183","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Confirm with Division of Elections whether county procurement is under state contract or independent bid — changes the 2028 timeline analysis","created_at":"<d-14>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-5","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2099056","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Request sponsor briefing — focus on results-embargo enforcement mechanism in Section 2 and chain of custody during pre-canvass period","created_at":"<d-7>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-6","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2096553","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Low impact operationally — flag for county counsel to review the death-reporting timeline in Section 1","created_at":"<d-30>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-7","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2098113","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Monitor committee hearings — highest-profile bill this session. Sponsor briefing requested; coordinate with Maria on implementation working group.","created_at":"<d-60>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"demo-note-8","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2098630","user_id":"demo-user","content":"Compare with A1680 — both touch late registration; may need coordinated testimony if both advance. Ask James to map the workflow differences.","created_at":"<d-21>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
